---
// 文章底部赞赏模块 - 简洁卡片式
---

<div class="sponsor-block">
  <p class="sponsor-title">☕ 如果这篇文章对你有帮助</p>
  <p class="sponsor-desc">欢迎支持 GeezCo 的技术分享</p>
  <div class="sponsor-links">
    <a href="/sponsor" class="sponsor-btn domestic">赞赏支持</a>
    <a href="https://buymeacoffee.com/wincy" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="sponsor-btn intl">
      Buy Me a Coffee
    </a>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .sponsor-block {
    background: linear-gradient(to right, #fef3c7, #ffedd5);
    border-radius: 1rem;
    padding: 2rem;
    text-align: center;
    margin: 2rem 0;
  }
  :global(html.dark) .sponsor-block {
    background: rgba(39, 39, 42, 0.5);
  }
  .sponsor-title {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #18181b;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }
  :global(html.dark) .sponsor-title {
    color: #fafafa;
  }
  .sponsor-desc {
    color: #71717a;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }
  :global(html.dark) .sponsor-desc {
    color: #a1a1aa;
  }
  .sponsor-links {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .sponsor-btn {
    padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
    border-radius: 0.5rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    transition: all 0.2s;
  }
  .sponsor-btn.domestic {
    background-color: #3b82f6;
    color: #ffffff;
  }
  .sponsor-btn.domestic:hover {
    background-color: #4f46e5;
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }
  :global(html.dark) .sponsor-btn.domestic {
    background-color: #60a5fa;
  }
  :global(html.dark) .sponsor-btn.domestic:hover {
    background-color: #3b82f6;
  }
  .sponsor-btn.intl {
    background-color: #fbbf24;
    color: #18181b;
  }
  .sponsor-btn.intl:hover {
    background-color: #f59e0b;
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }
  :global(html.dark) .sponsor-btn.intl {
    background-color: #fbbf24;
    color: #18181b;
  }
</style>